    "Name": "Aries I",
    "Details": "Configuration I focuses on a mix of energy and ballistic firepower with ER Large Lasers on both arms and HAG/20s on the torsos, supported by ample ammo storage. It also features multiple improved jump jets across the center torso, legs, and left torso for enhanced mobility. Heat management includes 16 double heat sinks, providing reliable cooling to sustain weapon and movement systems during prolonged engagements.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Multi Trac</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.19</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#0064e6>Used with permission from Aries Games and Miniatures.</color></b>",
